# The headers of the app's pages and files.
#
# The home page is the one page a search engine may list, so every other
# page and file of the app is marked noindex. An earlier form of this file
# marked every path ("/*") and took the mark away again for the home page,
# in a second block ("/", with "! X-Robots-Tag"). Deployed, the home page
# still came with "X-Robots-Tag: noindex". The local server, which applies
# the blocks in the order they are written, had sent it without.
#
# So no block here takes a header away, and no path gets the same header
# from two blocks: a path's headers are the same whatever order the blocks
# are applied in. ":part" stands for one or more characters that are not a
# slash. "/:part" is a path of one part, "/:part/*" is one part, a slash
# and whatever follows: together they are every path except "/" and a path
# that begins with two slashes, which no page or file of the app has.

/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'none'; script-src 'self' https://challenges.cloudflare.com; style-src 'self'; img-src 'self'; font-src 'self'; connect-src 'self'; frame-src https://challenges.cloudflare.com; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Permissions-Policy: publickey-credentials-create=(self), publickey-credentials-get=(self), camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=(), usb=(), serial=()
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000

/:part
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex

/:part/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex
